<h2>2. What this site is</h2>
<p>This is the publishing site of the Yundian platform: notes on front-end engineering, design, and everyday reading. Opinions here are personal and not affiliated with any organisation.</p>

<h2>3. Topics</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Front-end engineering (Vue, CSS, build tools)</li>
  <li>Design systems and visual standards</li>
  <li>Development notes and reading notes</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. How it is built</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Choice</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Framework</td><td>Eleventy 3 + Nunjucks</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Content</td><td>Markdown + Nunjucks</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Hosting</td><td>GitHub Actions build, Cloudflare Pages delivery</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Encryption</td><td>HTTPS everywhere, certificates by Cloudflare</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

